{"parse":{"title":"【铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期","pageid":3063,"revid":6599,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%87%E5%9B%BD%C2%B7%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%9F&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%87%E5%9B%BD%C2%B7%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%9F&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%87%E5%9B%BD%C2%B7%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%9F&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>【铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E7.BA.AA.E4.BA.8B.E7.B0.BF.E3.80.91.E6.B3.95.E7.9A.87.E5.9B.BD.C2.B7.E7.AC.AC.E4.B8.80.E6.9C.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期\">铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%87%E5%9B%BD%C2%B7%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：有版号的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-08-15 16:04<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2Ftza5hOVlYm2KkZx6tWFAJQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tza5hOVlYm2KkZx6tWFAJQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>各位团长好！<br />\n小场记今天给大家带来的是<br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>罗迪尼亚法皇国</b></font>的介绍<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息159.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/s4tzkpwm03oylk76e0uw1h2dgi1lcp4.png/150px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF159.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"140\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/s4tzkpwm03oylk76e0uw1h2dgi1lcp4.png/225px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF159.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/s4tzkpwm03oylk76e0uw1h2dgi1lcp4.png/300px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF159.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"460\" data-file-height=\"428\" /><img alt=\"官方消息160.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e1/a7vq7wb84pph4k1n5zfz0sueqlv2kyz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>由<font color=\"brown\"><b>光辉之子</b></font>创立的<font color=\"brown\"><b>庇护之光</b></font>，在<font color=\"brown\"><b>法皇</b></font>的引领下，逐渐发展为了辉煌雄伟的<font color=\"brown\"><b>【光辉之城】</b></font>，<font color=\"brown\"><b>骑士团</b></font>也随即踏上了遥远的<font color=\"brown\"><b>征途</b></font>...\n<p><br /><br />\n一起来看看，他们是如何英勇出征，打造出法皇国近百年的<font color=\"brown\"><b>【神圣辉煌】</b></font>吧！\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息161.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/08/forjp5xi9m3y08mcx9v5ub9a02tr49x.png/500px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF161.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"819\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/08/forjp5xi9m3y08mcx9v5ub9a02tr49x.png/750px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF161.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/08/forjp5xi9m3y08mcx9v5ub9a02tr49x.png/1000px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF161.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1769\" /><img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n远处还有什么<font color=\"brown\"><b>未知</b></font>在等待着骑士团<br />\n法皇国将会面临什么样的<font color=\"brown\"><b>挑战</b></font><br />\n各位团长请<font color=\"brown\"><b>敬请期待</b></font><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>小场记</b></font>带来的后续报道吧~\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息158.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/17/tovotb88gs57v1ws7o4lej8lby8xtfg.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1078\" height=\"490\" data-file-width=\"1078\" data-file-height=\"490\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163726\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 100/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2392/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.506      1 -total\n 52.92%   15.615      1 模板:面包屑\n 46.73%   13.789      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3063-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163726 and revision id 6599. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"科普","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息139.png","官方消息159.png","官方消息160.png","官方消息161.png","官方消息162.png","官方消息158.gif"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"【铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期"}],"displaytitle":"【铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|科普}}\n=铃兰纪事簿】法皇国·第一期=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=科普\n|时间= 2023-08-15 16:04\n|作者=有版号的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tza5hOVlYm2KkZx6tWFAJQ\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<br>\n[[File:官方消息139.png|link=]]\n<center>\n各位团长好！<br>\n小场记今天给大家带来的是<br>\n<font color=brown>'''罗迪尼亚法皇国'''</font>的介绍<br>\n[[File:官方消息159.png|150px|link=]][[File:官方消息160.png|link=]]\n{|style=\"width:90%\"\n|由<font color=brown>'''光辉之子'''</font>创立的<font color=brown>'''庇护之光'''</font>，在<font color=brown>'''法皇'''</font>的引领下，逐渐发展为了辉煌雄伟的<font color=brown>'''【光辉之城】'''</font>，<font color=brown>'''骑士团'''</font>也随即踏上了遥远的<font color=brown>'''征途'''</font>...\n<br><br>\n一起来看看，他们是如何英勇出征，打造出法皇国近百年的<font color=brown>'''【神圣辉煌】'''</font>吧！\n<br><br>\n|}\n[[File:官方消息161.png|500px|link=]][[File:官方消息162.png|link=]]\n远处还有什么<font color=brown>'''未知'''</font>在等待着骑士团<br>\n法皇国将会面临什么样的<font color=brown>'''挑战'''</font><br>\n各位团长请<font color=brown>'''敬请期待'''</font><br>\n<font color=brown>'''小场记'''</font>带来的后续报道吧~\n</center>\n<br><br>\n[[File:官方消息158.gif|link=]]\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:27.308176+00:00"}